# The one ffmpeg build the launcher offers (lib/core/ffmpeg_download.dart).
# .github/workflows/ffmpeg-release.yml fetches exactly this and nothing else, checks these hashes
# and publishes it under FFMPEG_TAG. A release of BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds tagged autobuild-* is kept for
# two years when it is the last build of its month; daily ones go after 14 days.
